
<% content_for :title, "Addiction | Bipolar Sober" %>

<main class="addiction-page">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="addiction-hero">
    <div class="addiction-hero-content">

      <p class="addiction-eyebrow">
        BIPOLAR SOBER / ADDICTION
      </p>

      <h1>
        <span>ON</span>
        <span>ADDICTION.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="addiction-intro">
        THE RELIEF WAS REAL.<br>
        SO WERE THE CONSEQUENCES.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- TOPICS -->
  <section class="addiction-topics" id="addiction-topics">

    <div class="addiction-topics-heading">

      <p>01 / ADDICTION</p>

      <h2>
        LOOK<br>
        BENEATH<br>
        THE SURFACE.
      </h2>

      <p class="addiction-topics-subtitle">
        The drinking. The relief. The excuses. The fallout.
        Understanding addiction means looking at the whole story,
        including the parts you'd rather forget and the ones you regret.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="addiction-grid">

      <!-- PERSPECTIVES -->
      <%= link_to "/addiction/perspectives",
          class: "addiction-card addiction-card-black" do %>

        <p class="addiction-card-number">01</p>

        <h3>PERSPECTIVES</h3>

        <p class="addiction-card-description">
          Three stories. Nine different lenses.
          Examine pain, pleasure, impulsivity,
          and the decisions that changed your life.
          Different perspectives. Same consequences.
        </p>

        <span>CHANGE THE VIEW →</span>

      <% end %>


      <!-- BIPOLAR & ADDICTION -->
      <%= link_to addiction_bipolar_path,
          class: "addiction-card addiction-card-purple" do %>

        <p class="addiction-card-number">02</p>

        <h3>
          BIPOLAR &amp;<br>
          ADDICTION
        </h3>

        <p class="addiction-card-description">
          Mania accelerates. Depression weighs you down.
          Mixed episodes are hitting the gas and the brake at the same time.
          Alcohol promises relief from all of them.
          Explore how bipolar symptoms, substance use,
          and impaired judgment can reinforce each other.
        </p>

        <span>UNTANGLE THE PATTERN →</span>

      <% end %>


      <!-- WHAT AM I ESCAPING? -->
      <%= link_to addiction_what_am_i_escaping_path,
          class: "addiction-card addiction-card-yellow" do %>

        <p class="addiction-card-number">03</p>

        <h3>
          WHAT AM I<br>
          ESCAPING?
        </h3>

        <p class="addiction-card-description">
          Pain. Boredom. Loneliness. Your own thoughts.
          Sometimes you're running from something.
          Sometimes you're chasing a feeling.
          What did alcohol promise to change?
        </p>

        <span>FIND THE REASON →</span>

      <% end %>


      <!-- TRIGGERS -->
      <%= link_to addiction_triggers_path,
          class: "addiction-card addiction-card-pink" do %>

        <p class="addiction-card-number">04</p>

        <h3>TRIGGERS</h3>

        <p class="addiction-card-description">
          A familiar place. A difficult emotion.
          An unexpected memory. Recognize the people,
          situations, and patterns that bring drinking
          back into focus before you act on them.
        </p>

        <span>KNOW YOUR TRIGGERS →</span>

      <% end %>


      <!-- CRAVINGS -->
      <%= link_to addiction_cravings_path,
          class: "addiction-card addiction-card-black" do %>

        <p class="addiction-card-number">05</p>

        <h3>CRAVINGS</h3>

        <p class="addiction-card-description">
          The urge arrives. The bargaining begins.
          Suddenly, you remember everything you liked
          about drinking and conveniently forget the rest.
          Understand the craving without obeying it.
        </p>

        <span>EXAMINE THE URGE →</span>

      <% end %>


      <!-- IMPULSIVITY -->
      <%= link_to addiction_impulsivity_path,
          class: "addiction-card addiction-card-purple" do %>

        <p class="addiction-card-number">06</p>

        <h3>IMPULSIVITY</h3>

        <p class="addiction-card-description">
          Want it. Do it. Regret it.
          When the distance between an impulse
          and a decision disappears, consequences
          can arrive before you've considered them.
          Learn to create a pause.
        </p>

        <span>BREAK THE CYCLE →</span>

      <% end %>


      <!-- SHAME & ACCOUNTABILITY -->
      <%= link_to addiction_shame_path,
          class: "addiction-card addiction-card-yellow" do %>

        <p class="addiction-card-number">07</p>

        <h3>
          SHAME &amp;<br>
          ACCOUNTABILITY
        </h3>

        <p class="addiction-card-description">
          You can't rewrite the past.
          You can acknowledge the harm, accept
          responsibility, and repair what you can.
          Your mistakes deserve attention,
          not a lifetime of self-condemnation.
        </p>

        <span>OWN IT. REPAIR IT. →</span>

      <% end %>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- BACK TO HOME -->
  <nav class="index-home-nav" aria-label="Return home">

    <%= link_to "← BACK TO HOME",
        root_path,
        class: "index-home-button" %>

  </nav>

</main>
